## Global Request Headers

All HTTP commands accept repeatable global request headers. Use `--header "Name: Value"` or `--header "Name=Value"` before or after the subcommand as needed.

```bash
{{ .App.Name }} --header "ACCESS-STATUS=inner" {{ .Group.Name }} <command>
{{ .App.Name }} {{ .Group.Name }} <command> --header "Name: Value"
```

